ISO-10303-21;
/* P012: DOCUMENT_FILE entity references 'assembly_model.stpz' (gzip-compressed STEP) and 'annotation_view.stpx' (STEP-XML AP242 form); EXTERNALLY_DEFINED_ITEM pointing to stpz/stpx variants; kernel must decompress/parse or reject with E_UNSUPPORTED_VARIANT; silently returning empty with no diagnostic is the bug; NEXT_ASSEMBLY_USAGE_OCCURRENCE scaffolding for §12.6 lint; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty */
